cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these proofs, please cite them as below, with Erdős Problem #982 and the formal-conjectures statement."
type: software
title: "Lean proofs from Quantavane: Erdős Problem #982, the case n = 8"
abstract: "A Lean 4 proof of the case n = 8 of Erdős Problem #982 in the form of formal-conjectures' statement: every strictly convex octagon has a vertex with at least 4 distinct distances to the other vertices. Geometric lemmas from orientation signs reduce the question to a finite CNF, refuted by an LRAT certificate checked by Lean's verified checker."
authors:
